   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP Veterankommissioner</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">bidrag till UNDPs st&#xF6;dprojekt f&#xF6;r tv&#xE5; kommissioner med m&#xE5;ls&#xE4;ttningen att n&#xE5; en &#xF6;verenskommelse om kriterier f&#xF6;r vem som kan anses vara veteran, identifiera faktiska veteraner fr&#xE5;n striderna 1975-1979 respektive 1981-1999, samt att ta fram rekommendationer f&#xF6;r hur integreringen ska fortskrida.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">purpose of the project is to provide co-ordinated donor assistance towards the Commissions&apos; achievement of its objective: &quot;A broad-based agreement has been reached on who are to be considered legitimate veterans in East Timor, including a set of recommendations on how the needs of veterans can be addressed in the future&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
